10 REM COUNT TO 15 IN BINARY ON THE LEDS (PC0-PC3)
20 REM GPIO PORT C'S CLOCK ON (RCC APB2PCENR)
30 POKE $40021018, PEEK($40021018) OR $10
40 REM PC0-PC3 PUSH-PULL OUTPUTS (GPIOC CFGLR)
50 POKE $40011000, PEEK($40011000) AND NOT $FFFF OR $1111
60 FOR I=0 TO 15
70 POKE $4001100C, I: PRINT I;" ";
80 DELAY 250
90 NEXT I
100 PRINT
